{
  "name": "dsh-ris-yds",
  "version": "1.2.1",
  "description": "YonBIP YDS local runtime for the DSH agent: config resolution (project settings.json + optional .env), YYCToken, confcenter sync, SOCKS forward, yms-home build/start/stop with JDWP, and dsh-ris-ide run-config integration. Cross-OS (linux/darwin/win32, WSL aware). · YonBIP YDS 本地运行时：项目配置解析（settings.json / .env）、YYCToken、confcenter 拉取、SOCKS 转发、yms-home 构建与启停（含 JDWP 调试）、dsh-ris-ide 启动器集成；跨平台（linux/darwin/win32，识别 WSL）。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/ris-cloud/dsh-ris-yds.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://gitee.com/riscloud/dsh-ris-yds#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://gitee.com/riscloud/dsh-ris-yds/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "yds",
    "yonbip",
    "yonyou",
    "yms",
    "liberty"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "dsh": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./cli": "./lib/cli.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "bin": {
    "yds": "bin/yds.js"
  },
  "files": [
    "LICENSE",
    "README.md",
    "bin",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "lib",
    "native",
    "resources",
    "skills",
    "test",
    "assets"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test \"test/*.test.mjs\"",
    "check:listing": "node bin/check-listing.mjs"
  }
}
